ludes a casino, the Opéra de Monte-Carlo, and the office of Les Ballets de Monte-Carlo. The Casino de Monte-Carlo is owned and operated by the Société des Bains de Mer (SBM), a public company in which the government of Monaco and the ruling princely family have a majority interest.","wpu":"Monte Carlo Casino","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/The_Casino%2C_Monte_Carlo_-_panoramio_cropped.jpg/960px-The_Casino%2C_Monte_Carlo_-_panoramio_cropped.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Opéra de Monaco","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":43.738959,"lo":7.428371,"d":481,"w":"https://www.opera.mc/","ph":"+377 98 06 28 00","wp":"fr:Opéra de Monte-Carlo"},{"n":"Plage du Solarium","g":"sights","k":"beach","la":43.733434,"lo":7.428847,"d":482},{"n":"Musée de la Chapelle de la Visitation","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":43.73146,"lo":7.425417,"d":517,"w":"https://www.monte-carlo.mc/en/tourism/musee-chapelle/","ph":"+37793500700"},{"n":"Crique des Pêcheurs","g":"sights","k":"beach","la":43.731923,"lo":7.427911,"d":551},{"n":"Oceanographic Museum of Monaco","g":"sights","k":"museum","la":43.730663,"lo":7.425534,"d":606,"h":"Oct-Mar 10:00-18:00; Apr-Jun,Sep 10:00-19:00; Jul-Aug 10:00-20:00; Dec 25 off","w":"https://musee.oceano.org","wp":"en:Musée Océanographique","ds":"The Oceanographic Museum (French: Musée océanographique), is a museum of marine sciences in Monaco City, Monaco. This building is part of the Institut océanographique, which is committed to sharing its knowledge of the oceans.","wpu":"Oceanographic Museum of Monaco","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Monaco_BW_2011-06-07_17-50-43.jpg/960px-Monaco_BW_2011-06-07_17-50-43.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Prince's Palace of Monaco","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":43.731278,"lo":7.42015,"d":609,"h":"10:00-18:00; Jul,Aug 10:00-19:00; Oct 17-Mar 25 off","w":"https://www.palais.mc/","ph":"+377 93 25 18 31","wp":"en:Prince's Palace of Monaco","ds":"The Prince's Palace of Monaco (French: Palais princier de Monaco; Monégasque: Palaçi principescu) is the official residence of the Sovereign Prince of Monaco. Built in 1191 as a Genoese fortress, during its long and often dramatic history it has been bombarded and besieged by many foreign powers.","wpu":"Prince's Palace of Monaco","img":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/%D0%9C%D0%9E%D0%9D%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%9E_-_panoramio_%284%29.jpg/960px-%D0%9C%D0%9E%D0%9D%D0%90%D0%9A%D0%9E_-_panoramio_%284%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"},{"n":"Carlos I de Portugal","g":"sights","k":"monument","la":43.730347,"lo":7.42455,"d":630},{"n":"Metropole","g":"sights","k":"hotel","la":43.740935,"lo":7.427918,"d":632,"w":"https://www.metropole.com/","ph":"+377 93 15 15 15","wp":"fr:Hôtel Métropole Monte-Carlo","wifi":1},{"n":"Fairmont Hairpin","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":43.740206,"lo":7.4298,"d":660},{"n":"Ayrton Senna","g":"sights","k":"attraction","la":43.740189,"lo":7.42995,"d":667},{"n":"Zoological Garden of Monaco","g":"sights","k":"zoo","la":43.73116,"lo":7.418647,"d":688,"wp":"en:Zoological Garden of Monaco","ds":"The Jardin Animalier de Monaco is a zoo located on the Esplanade Rainer III, in Monaco's Fontvieille ward, on the southern side of the Rock of Monaco. It was established by Rainier III, Prince of Monaco in 1954. Almost 300 animals representing some 60 different species are held in the zoo.","wpu":"Zoological Garden of Monaco"},{"n":"Le Jardin Animalier","g":"sights","k":"zoo","la":43.73114,"lo":7.417889,"d":730,"h":"Mar 01-May 31: 10:00-12:00,14:00-18:00; Jun 01-Sep 30: 09:00-12:00,14:00-19:00; Oct 01-Feb 28: 10:00-12:00,14:00-17:00","w":"https://www.palais.mc/fr/musees-et-visites/le-jardin-animalier-de-monaco-1-41.html","ph":"+37793504030","wp":"en:Zoological Garden of Monaco","ds":"The Jardin Animalier de Monaco is a zoo located on 